  "description": "Ji Chul Min, a perpetual loser, suddenly gains the ability to see ghosts one day. Because revealing this power would cause spirits to haunt him, he desperately acts like he cannot see them. However, a persistent ghost eventually catches onto his secret and begins following him around everywhere. As it turns out, this haunting ghost is a former Jiu Jitsu monster.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69170913), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%B7%80%EC%8B%A0%EB%93%A4%EB%A6%B0-%EA%B7%B8%EB%9E%98%ED%94%8C%EB%9F%AC/4926)",
